  "body": "No browsers have shipped this as far as I can find, and webkit and chromium indicated no intent to ship:\n* webkit wontfix: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=82801\n* chromium wontfix: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=284600\n* discussion to remove from the spec: https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-canvas-api/2013JanMar/0017.html\n\nNot sure if this needs to be discussed anywhere else, but there's been no movement on it in about 5 years, so seems like time to remove it.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3796/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 4, 2018, 5:32 AM GMT (cb93b99)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3796/5a6930a...cb93b99/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 4, 2018, 5:32 AM GMT (cb93b99)\">diff</a> )",
